        "original_id": "83b392df-2264-56c2-bdcf-f69a28b2b4fa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Meadowbrook State Parkway, South Oyster Bay, Loop Parkway, North Merrick, New York\n- Roads: Southern State Parkway, New York State Route 102\n- Topics: roadway connections, 2010 census\n\nFacts:\n- The Meadowbrook State Parkway heads north, crosses South Oyster Bay, intersects Loop Parkway, continues onto the mainland, and connects to the Southern State Parkway in North Merrick.\n- North Merrick, New York, had a population of 12,272 at the 2010 census.\n- New York State Route 102 passes under the Meadowbrook State Parkway but has no ramps connecting the two roads.",
